{"caption":"","data":"unsolved goals\nd : ℕ\nA : ElectromagneticPotential d\n𝓕 : FreeSpace\nhA : ContDiff ℝ ∞ A.val\nJ : LorentzCurrentDensity d\nhJ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ J\nh : IsExtrema 𝓕 A J\nt : Time\nx : Space d\ni : Fin d\nhMaxwell :\n  ∀ (t : Time) (x : Space d),\n    Space.div (electricField 𝓕.c A t) x = LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x / 𝓕.ε₀ ∧\n      ∀ (i : Fin d),\n        𝓕.μ₀ * 𝓕.ε₀ * (∂ₜ (fun t => electricField 𝓕.c A t x) t).ofLp i =\n          ∑ j, Space.deriv j (fun x => magneticFieldMatrix 𝓕.c A t x (j, i)) x -\n            𝓕.μ₀ * (LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J t x).ofLp i\nhGauss :\n  ∀ (t : Time) (x : Space d),\n    Space.div (electricField 𝓕.c A t) x = 𝓕.ε₀⁻¹ * LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x\n⊢ ∂ₜ (∂ₜ fun x_1 => (electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x).ofLp i) t =\n    𝓕.c.val ^ 2 * ∑ j, Space.deriv j (Space.deriv j fun x => (electricField 𝓕.c A t x).ofLp i) x -\n        𝓕.c.val ^ 2 / 𝓕.ε₀ * Space.deriv i (fun x => LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x) x -\n      𝓕.c.val ^ 2 * 𝓕.μ₀ * ∂ₜ (fun x_1 => (LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J x_1 x).ofLp i) t","endPos":{"column":6,"line":401},"fileName":"/Users/hellokitsch/_feynlang/leanProject/week4/experiment/runs/20261024T000653+0900/revalidation/P5/f4973c0e87ffd6b8a3d43d5dfdd2817bca8a1e077b2d76e90def08ed6e864a51-candidate/physlib-v4.32.0/fresh/lean/002_saved_candidate/candidate.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"Tactic.unsolvedGoals","pos":{"column":60,"line":384},"severity":"error"}
